OL,5,G0900 Saturday Morning
OL,6,     FNicky Spence plays the best
OL,7,     Fclassical music and meets the
OL,8,     Fmusicians who make it happen,
OL,9,     Fincluding rising star
OL,10,     Fmezzo-soprano Aigul Akhmetshina.
OL,11,G1200 Earlier... with Jools Holland
OL,12,     FJools is joined by percussionist
OL,13,     Fand film producer Ray Cooper.
OL,14,G1300 Key Changes: Radio 3's...
OL,15,     F...Essential History of Classical
OL,16,     FMusic. 1814, Vienna. As Europe's
OL,17,     Fleaders gather for the Congress of
OL,18,     FVienna, a fashionable new dance is
OL,19,     Fcapturing the imagination of
OL,20,     Fballroom crowds.
