OL,5,G1400 Record Review
OL,6,     FSarah Walker selects the best new
OL,7,     Fclassical releases and is joined
OL,8,     Fby Emily MacGregor, who shares her
OL,9,     F5 favourite recordings of music by
OL,10,     Fthis week's Proms Composer:
OL,11,     FProkofiev.
OL,12,G1600 BBC Proms 2026
OL,13,     FHuw Stephens explores connections
OL,14,     Fbetween music and literature on
OL,15,     Fthe theme of Welsh myth and
OL,16,     Flegend. Live from Theatr Clwyd
OL,17,     Fwith Sinfonia Cymru, Owen Teale
OL,18,     Fand Sian-Reese Williams.
