OL,5,G1730 This Classical Life
OL,6,     FJess Gillam sits down for a
OL,7,     Flistening party with the Canadian
OL,8,     Fbaritone Gerald Finley. They share
OL,9,     Fmusic by Mozart, the King's
OL,10,     FSingers, Stan Getz, Vivaldi and
OL,11,     FStacey Kent.
OL,12,G1830 Music Planet
OL,13,     FLopa Kothari presents the best in
OL,14,     Fglobal folk and roots-based music,
OL,15,     Fwith Turkish psychedelia from BaBa
OL,16,     FZuLa and sound artist Jim Nollman
OL,17,     Fduetting the blues with his local
OL,18,     Forcas.
