OL,5,G1930 BBC Proms 2026
OL,6,     FLive at the BBC Proms: Mirga
OL,7,     FGrazinyte-Tyla conducts the Oslo
OL,8,     FPhilharmonic in Prokofiev's Romeo
OL,9,     Fand Juliet, and Stravinsky's
OL,10,     FViolin Concerto with soloist
OL,11,     FPatricia Kopatchinskaja.
OL,12,G2200 New Generation Artists
OL,13,     FHana Chang plays Edvard Grieg's
OL,14,     FViolin Sonata no. 2, a work
OL,15,     Freflecting the happiness of his
OL,16,     Frecent marriage as well as his
OL,17,     Flove of the rhythms of Norwegian
OL,18,     Ffolk music.
